ss=\"wp-element-caption\">Best Invisalign Orthodontist in Coimbatore<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Say Cheeese.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In a selfie and Reels-dominated era, who doesn\u2019t like a perfect set of teeth? And in a city like Coimbatore, which is known for its advanced healthcare facilities, finding the right Orthodontists is a great first step towards achieving that.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this article, we will be covering some of the top Orthodontists in Coimbatore, who are known for their vast experience in their field and innovative approach to ensure you have a sweet and flawless smile. But, before that, what do orthodontists exactly do and what is Invisalign? Let\u2019s check that out.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How is an Orthodontist different from a dentist:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While both professionals are dedicated to taking care of your oral health, there is a subtle difference in the kind of specialization they undergo. While dentists specialize in complete dental care that includes cleaning, fillings, teeth whitening, and crowns, orthodontists specialize in preventing and treating misaligned teeth. To achieve that, orthodontists use braces, palatal expanders, Invisalign, and other tools.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When to See an Orthodontist?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With the knowledge of what oral care you need, you have to decide if you would require a dentist or an orthodontist. Here are some of the most common reasons people will go to an orthodontist:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you have teeth that are crowded or overlapping, then an orthodontist can help you straighten them and put a big smile on your face.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Many people have large gaps and uneven spaces between their teeth, which can be a simple fix through Invisalign.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If there is pain in your jaws or if you feel there is a misalignment in your jaws, then an orthodontist can bring relief to that pain through the right treatment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can see an orthodontist, in case there is an improper alignment of teeth when you close your mouth.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There are other issues that are seen in babies like early or late loss of baby teeth, breathing through the mouth, and thumb-sucking can require an orthodontist\u2019s attention.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Invisalign?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign.jpg\" alt=\"what is invisalign\" class=\"wp-image-4043\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign.jpg 1000w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To understand that, we have to know what Aligners are. Aligners are basically 3D digitally scanned aligners which are created to treat misaligned teeth. Invisalign is a brand of clear aligners manufactured by the US brand, Align Technology. So far, more than 14 million patients have benefited through Invisalign.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In India, Invisalign entered the market just a few years ago and has already taken the nation by storm. It negates all the disadvantages of regular braces and makes the whole process of aligning misaligned teeth better, and comfortable.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">&nbsp;Benefits of Invisalign:<\/h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/advantages-of-invisalign.jpg\" alt=\"advantages of invisalign\" class=\"wp-image-4044\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/advantages-of-invisalign.jpg 1000w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/advantages-of-invisalign-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/advantages-of-invisalign-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Advantages of Invisalign<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>As the name suggests, the aligners are invisible, which makes it a discreet option for people to straighten their teeth.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Unlike braces, which are made of metal, these are made of plastic, so they are automatically way more comfortable than the usual braces.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>They can be easily removed while brushing, eating, or flossing, which is a huge inconvenience in traditional braces.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Because it is 3D printed, patients can gauge and predict results before starting their treatment.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>It is customized to the last inch and fits perfectly to the exact shape of your teeth.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">List of 5 Best Invisalign Orthodontists in Coimbatore<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Find the list of 5 best Invisalign orthodontists in Coimbatore who specializes in teeth and jaw alignment at  affordable cost.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">01. Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar<\/h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign-orthodontist-in-coi